{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>HISTORY:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When Count Dracula inherits the legendary Dark Dreams Hotel, a once-glorious resort, he expects a grand legacy - but instead finds himself in a new nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678990/extras/Banner_1.png?t=1748930056\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As Dracula prepares to restore the hotel to its former grandeur, he discovers that rival hotel owners\u2014witches, werewolves, and magicians\u2014are plotting against him. With his rivals getting up to no good, it\u2019s up to you to help Dracula revive the hotel, outsmart the competition, and uncover hidden secrets lurking in the shadows. Gather resources, recruit legendary experts, and ensure the resort is ready for the grand reopening. But beware of the Ministry of Control and Prohibition, which has its own list of impossible demands!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678990/extras/Banner_2.png?t=1748930056\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you restore the Dark Dreams Hotel to its former glory? Or will Dracula\u2019s inheritance become his greatest nightmare? Help Dracula out in Incredible Dracula 12: License to Relax!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678990/extras/Banner_3.png?t=1748930056\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Incredible Dracula: License to Relax, as in any time manager you have to accurately calculate the time for building, collecting resources and timely use of bonuses. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game has a large variety of buildings and unique items, collecting them you will perform tasks and participate in unique adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" 